            <title>2.11</title>
            <pubDate>Mon, 19 Oct 2026 23:37:55 +0700</pubDate>
            <description><![CDATA[<html><head><meta charset='utf-8'><style>:root{color-scheme:light dark}body{font:13px/1.45 -apple-system,system-ui,sans-serif;margin:0;padding:0 4px}h2{font-size:20px;margin:6px 0 4px}h3{font-size:13px;margin:16px 0 4px}p{margin:4px 0}.date{opacity:.6}ul{margin:4px 0;padding-left:20px}li{margin:4px 0}code{font:12px ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace}</style></head><body><h2>2.11</h2><p class="date">Release date: 19 Oct 2026</p><h3>New in 2.11</h3><ul><li>Free plan keeps the Week window; 5h, 24h and Month need a license</li><li>After the trial, 5 skills can be paused for free; the row shows how many pauses are left</li><li>The cache-expired card shows how long ago the cache ran out and fades an hour later</li><li>A skill description over the limit is marked orange instead of red</li><li>Fixes: license activation on server errors, transcripts with long first lines, archive dates in Buddhist-calendar regions</li></ul></body></html>]]></description>
