        <item>
            <title>2.10</title>
            <pubDate>Sat, 17 Oct 2026 02:10:08 +0700</pubDate>
            <description><![CDATA[<html><head><meta charset='utf-8'><style>:root{color-scheme:light dark}body{font:13px/1.45 -apple-system,system-ui,sans-serif;margin:0;padding:0 4px}h2{font-size:20px;margin:6px 0 4px}h3{font-size:13px;margin:16px 0 4px}p{margin:4px 0}.date{opacity:.6}ul{margin:4px 0;padding-left:20px}li{margin:4px 0}code{font:12px ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace}</style></head><body><h2>2.10</h2><p class="date">Release date: 17 Oct 2026</p><h3>New in 2.10</h3><ul><li>Updates for skills and plugins from any source: skills.sh, plugin marketplaces and git clones. Checked once a day, with Update with backup and Undo</li><li>New "Pay attention" card when the last hour used more tokens than any hour in 30 days, with the reason: a heavier model or the tool that took most</li><li>The number next to the bolt in the menu bar matches the limit in the panel header</li><li>Opens on the Month window and remembers your pick</li><li>Free plan: the 24h window; 5h, Week and Month need a license</li></ul></body></html>]]></description>
